      <Docs>
        <param name="frozenCalleePolicy">When the callback recipient's process is frozen, this parameter
            specifies when/whether callbacks are invoked. It's important to choose a strategy that's
            right for the use case. Leaving the policy unset with <c>#FROZEN_CALLEE_POLICY_UNSET</c>
            is not recommended as it allows callbacks to be invoked while the recipient is frozen.</param>
